    "detailed_description": "Explore the islands of Wake in a sea plane. Scattered throughout the rolling hills, along steep cliffs, and in complex cave networks, are the beacons of a lost communication system. By transporting signals between these towers, it can be restored, but that might only be achieved by the most skilled of seaplane pilots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game starts in a free roaming mode where you can explore the environment and get familiar with controlling the plane. There are racing challenges where you can set personal high scores. To start a race visit one of the main towers.",
